Error [jet.UnsupportedCompileTimeValue]: `#run { … }` is used as a value, which this compiler does not support yet
  --> tests/ui/e0391_comptime_block_as_value.jet:3:12
    |
  3 |     total: #run {
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Jet makes the block's final expression its value; only a block holding a single final expression is folded today
 Fix: Write `name: #run value` with one final expression, or a `#run { … }` statement
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0391
